  {
    "id": 2022007040050,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、お待たせしました……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bgm": "101",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう、小糸\r\n夏期講習、お疲れ様",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022007040060,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "すみません\r\n迎えに来てもらっちゃって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいんだよ\r\nこの夏休み、小糸はすごく頑張ってくれてるからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "このくらいしかできなくて\r\nむしろ申し訳ないくらいだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022007040070,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、そんなこと……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この後オーディションだし\r\n少しでも移動中に休んでくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022007040080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……はい\r\nありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022007040090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんのお陰で夏期講習と\r\nオーディションやレッスンも両立できてるし",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022007040100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "お仕事もさせてもらって……\r\nわたしひとりじゃ、絶対できてないので",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022007040110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "すごく、充実した毎日になってると思います",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\nよかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022007040120,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、そんなに結果が\r\n出せてる訳じゃないですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは\r\nまだまだ夏はこれからだ、小糸",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺がしてあげられることはそんなに多くないけど\r\nでも、できる限りのことはするからさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "一緒に、頑張っていこうな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022007040130,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022007040140,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……はい",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……？\r\n……どうした、小糸",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "夏期講習で\r\n疲れたか？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "オーディション、\r\n緊張するか？",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "スケジュール\r\nやっぱりきついか？",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022007040150,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ……え、えっと\r\nあ、そ、そんなことないですよ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか？\r\nそれならいいけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まだ時間もあるし、\r\nちょっとコンビニでも寄っていこうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "暑いし、アイスでも買ってさ\r\n小糸、何味がいい？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022007040160,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え……何味……\r\nど、どうしよう……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、まあ着いてから選ぼうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022007040170,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、そうですね……！\r\nそれがいいかもしれないです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、そうしよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫だよ\r\n時間はあるんだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "autoWaitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
