  {
    "id": 2022007040180,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え……\r\nあ、そ、そうですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022007040190,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わたしもそろそろ、\r\nいい結果を出したいですし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん\r\n今回のオーディションがいい結果になったら嬉しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だけど、そうじゃなかったからって\r\nそれが全く意味のないことになるわけじゃない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸が挑戦したってこととか\r\nそこで経験したこと、感じたこと、学んだこと",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "全部に意味がある",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022007040200,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……そうですよね",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022007040210,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そうだったら、いいな……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022007040220,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "収録もあってオーディションもあってレッスンもあって\r\n小糸は勉強も頑張ってるし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "スケジュール、詰め込みすぎちゃったかな\r\nすまん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022007040230,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "い、いえ……！\r\nそんなこと無いですよ、全然……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022007040240,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "全然、余裕ですし……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200704/2022007040240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか？\r\nそれならいいんだけどさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちょっと欲張りすぎたかなって思ってさ\r\nそれが、悪いことだとは思わないけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、ひとつひとつに\r\n丁寧に向き合えるようにしたいんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
